message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the corrected publication package."
title: "External transport of donor-level SLE classifiers across two cohorts: corrected Geneformer V1 and pseudobulk analysis"
type: software
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: 2026-10-04
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/mohamad679/lupus-singlecell-foundation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mohamad679/lupus-singlecell-foundation"
authors:
  - given-names: "Mohammad Javad"
    family-names: "Asgari"
    email: "m.asgari77@gmail.com"
abstract: >
  Reviewer-facing corrected donor-level reanalysis of Geneformer V1 embeddings
  against pseudobulk and age-only baselines for SLE-versus-healthy
  discrimination. The corrected shared-gene external AUROCs are 0.7344,
  0.8984, and 0.5781, respectively. The external cohort had already been
  examined, so this package is a corrected reanalysis rather than a new
  untouched confirmatory validation.
